# Refactor Skill

Reference with **@claude-skills/refactor** when refactoring code or reducing duplication.

## When to use

- User asks to refactor, simplify, or clean up code
- Reducing duplication (DRY), improving structure, or renaming for clarity
- Extracting functions/classes or reorganizing without changing behavior

## Principles

- Preserve behavior; keep or add tests so refactors are safe
- Small, incremental steps where possible
- Follow existing project structure and naming
- Remove dead code and unused imports as you go
- Avoid refactoring and feature changes in the same edit unless asked
